site","seq":110,"t":148720,"type":"note","station":"s6","source":"Reviewer","text":"order instructions: index.html, #order: it says \"Call us or come by the counter. We do not take orders by email yet.\" but never says orders can't be placed through this page. The goal for the project says the site is preview-only and the bakery takes orders by phone or at the counter, so a visitor may still hunt for an order form or button. Add one plain line, e.g. that this page can't take orders and to please call or come by."},{"runId":"saved-bakery-site","seq":111,"t":148720,"type":"note","station":"s6","source":"Reviewer","text":"menu clarity: index.html, #hours: the sell-out warning \"The cardamom buns usually sell out by 11 am on weekends.\" sits under Opening hours, not under the Cardamom bun in #menu. A visitor reading the priced menu won't connect it to that item. Put the note next to the cardamom bun, or repeat it there."},{"runId":"saved-bakery-site","seq":112,"t":148720,"type":"card","station":"s6","card":{"stepId":"s6","kind":"review","title":"Second read","state":"done","review":"none","summary":"7 issues (2 major)","checked":[],"agentOnly":["The page is accurate and covers every fact in Ines's notes, with hours first and the priced menu right after. The problems below are about emphasis and a few unstated details, not wrong facts.","Major: order instructions: index.html, #order: it says \"Call us or come by the counter. We do not take orders by email yet.\" but never says orders can't be placed through this page. The goal for the project says the site is preview-only and the bakery takes orders by phone or at the counter, so a visitor may still hunt for an order form or button. Add one plain line, e.g. that this page can't take orders and to please call or come by.","Major: menu clarity: index.html, #hours: the sell-out warning \"The cardamom buns usually sell out by 11 am on weekends.\" sits under Opening hours, not under the Cardamom bun in #menu. A visitor reading the priced menu won't connect it to that item. Put the note next to the cardamom bun, or repeat it there.","Minor: hours clarity: index.html, header .open-line: \"Open Tuesday to Sunday. Closed on Mondays.\" is the most prominent hours line, but it hides that weekdays close at 3:00 pm and weekends at 2:00 pm. A skimmer could assume one closing time. Show the split, or point to the table.","Minor: hours clarity: Hours are stated three times in three formats: the header pill, the #hours table, and the footer .footer-hours line. The footer crams both ranges into one dense sentence. Trim the footer to a short pointer back to the table.","Minor: order instructions: The phone number shows up only in #order and the footer, so someone with a quick question (or checking the hours) has to scroll to find it; consider a phone line in the header. Also, both tel: links use \"tel:+15550142290\", which adds a +1 country code that isn't in Ines's notes, and the number is a 555 placeholder, so confirm the real number and dialling format before publishing.","Minor: missing / structure: index.html, #baking heading \"Baked here every morning\": the first two lines fit (the 4 am bake and Teo's starter), but the third line, \"Ines Okafor opened the bakery in 2019 with her brother Teo Okafor, who bakes the bread.\", is a founding-story fact dropped under a morning-baking heading. Retitle the section or move that line.","Minor: tone: index.html, #order panel: the full-width dark-brown fill is the heaviest element on the page, against the brief's \"warm and simple ... nothing flashy\". Worth a second look to be sure it still reads warm rather than corporate."],"counts":{"units":0,"checked":0,"agent":7,"sentBack":0,"fixed":0,"dropped":0},"calls":1,"ms":33841,"version":1}},{"runId":"saved-bakery-site","seq":113,"t":148720,"type":"step-end","station":"s6","summary":{"units":0,"kept":7,"sentBack":0,"fixed":0,"dropped":0}},{"runId":"saved-bakery-site","seq":114,"t":148720,"type":"step-start","s